<div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ENCAISSEMENT</span><h1>Nouvelle vente</h1><p class="muted">Sélectionnez les articles vendus.</p></div><a href="<?= e(url('/sales')) ?>" class="btn secondary">← Retour</a></div><form class="panel stack" method="post" action="<?= e(url('/sales/save')) ?>" id="sale-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= csrf() ?>"><div class="form-grid"><label>Client<select name="customer_id"><option value="">Client comptoir</option><?php foreach($customers as $c): ?><option value="<?= (int)$c['id'] ?>"><?= e($c['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>Mode de paiement<select name="payment_method"><option value="cash">Espèces</option><option value="mobile_money">Mobile Money</option><option value="bank">Virement</option><option value="card">Carte</option></select></label></div><div id="sale-lines"><div class="sale-line"><select name="product_id[]" required><option value="">Choisir un produit</option><?php foreach($products as $p): ?><option value="<?= (int)$p['id'] ?>" data-price="<?= (float)$p['sell_price'] ?>"><?= e($p['name']) ?> — <?= money($p['sell_price']) ?> (stock <?= (int)$p['stock'] ?>)</option><?php endforeach; ?></select><input type="number" name="quantity[]" min="1" value="1" required><button type="button" class="icon-btn remove-line">×</button></div></div><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="add-line">＋ Ajouter un article</button><p class="muted">Le stock est vérifié et décrémenté automatiquement à l'enregistrement.</p><button class="btn primary">Valider la vente et générer la facture</button></form>